# textures_normal_record_checks_map_isolate: Every refusal of a normal texture's record and of the texture dimension check, one object each, each listed in its own exec so that its creation's fault is its own; the probe buffer shows which execs ran. Short reads, an unknown commandType, a memoryless descriptor, a texture Metal refuses, then the dimension checks in the order the code makes them, for an uncompressed format (kind 0) and a block-compressed one (kind 1, BC1_RGBA: 4x4 blocks of 8 bytes). A passing uncompressed, compressed and type 3 record close each group.
